Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 13:40:13 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 31/71] Show live context and cache meters under the composer

The footer reported only how much of the context window was left, which
says nothing about what the next request will actually cost. Append the
context size, the cached share, and the new-versus-cached split of the
next request to the existing context line.

The numbers come from the per-request token usage snapshot rather than the
session totals, which would overstate both the context size and the cached
share.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
